        <mxCell id="note" value="Important boundaries&#xa;• UI never calls API Fetcher, providers, RabbitMQ or PostgreSQL&#xa;• API Fetcher only collects data and publishes to MQ&#xa;• History Service is the only PostgreSQL owner&#xa;• Each VM has its own isolated Compose network; cross-VM traffic uses bridged LAN" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1660" y="740" width="260" height="250" as="geometry"/>
